# Long River Lurker: on declining the "may", Bot1's Grizzly Bears stay the same permanent, still tapped from attacking. The unblockable
# effect lasted only through turn 3: on turn 5 Bot2's Ornithopter may block the Bears again, so no damage goes through (CR 611.2a).

